{
  "$schema": "../schema/component.schema.json",
  "id": "halo-search",
  "title": "光晕搜索框",
  "description": "发光光环搜索输入框：悬停与聚焦时光环旋转，支持 v-model 绑定关键词与回车 search 事件。",
  "category": "form",
  "tags": [
    "css",
    "tailwind",
    "input",
    "ui-verse"
  ],
  "aliases": [],
  "platforms": [
    "web"
  ],
  "props": [
    {
      "name": "class",
      "type": "HTMLAttributes[\"class\"]",
      "required": false,
      "description": "追加到根容器的额外 CSS 类；其余透传属性落到内部输入框。",
      "default": "\"\""
    },
    {
      "name": "modelValue",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "description": "双向绑定值",
      "vModel": true,
      "default": "\"\""
    }
  ],
  "events": [
    {
      "name": "search",
      "payload": "[keyword: string]",
      "description": "在输入框内按回车时触发，参数为当前关键词"
    },
    {
      "name": "update:modelValue",
      "description": "modelValue 变化时触发（v-model 同步）",
      "payload": "(value: string)"
    }
  ],
  "slots": [],
  "exposes": [],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Web 演示",
      "path": "app/components/reborn/examples/halo-search/HaloSearchDemo.vue",
      "source": "demo",
      "platform": "web",
      "code": "<template>\n  <div class=\"relative z-0 flex h-96 w-full flex-col items-center justify-center\">\n    <HaloSearch />\n\n    <span class=\"text-muted-foreground mt-24 font-light\">\n      Try hovering over component and typing in it.\n    </span>\n  </div>\n</template>\n"
    }
  ],
  "related": [],
  "whenToUse": [
    "落地页 / 概念页需要未来感搜索入口的视觉区块。",
    "悬停与输入时有光晕反馈的装饰性搜索框。"
  ],
  "whenNotToUse": [
    "需要清空按钮、尺寸档位与表单联动的功能性搜索框，改用 reborn-search-box。",
    "需要占位符轮播与提交动画的输入框，改用 vanishing-input。"
  ],
  "pitfalls": [
    "仅 web 端可用。",
    "v-model 绑定输入框关键词，回车派发 search（输入法组字中的回车除外）。",
    "组件关闭了 inheritAttrs：除 class 外的属性（含 style、placeholder、原生事件）落到内部 input。"
  ],
  "dependencies": [],
  "install": {
    "cli": "npx reborn-ui@latest add halo-search"
  },
  "sourceRefs": {
    "web": [
      "app/components/reborn/ui/halo-search/HaloSearch.vue",
      "app/components/reborn/ui/halo-search/index.ts"
    ]
  },
